[sliver] Each 0.90 × 54.5 mm plane is the continuous pocket-floor stop Derek requested from the four-bar Pisco fit. The floor catches the rising crest under roll.
alternatives: Cutting this strip to a point removes the bearing area that limits roll. Widening it into the lead-in shortens the opening ramp.
